  "prefLabel": "En 1007.04 Time to Process Screens",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1007.04 Time to Process Screens. Within 15 business days after the utility notifies the applicant that the application is complete, the utility shall notify the applicant whether the facility meets all the applicable simplified process screens. If the applicant is proposing to interconnect within a spot network or area network and an interval meter is required pursuant to En 1007.03(e)(3), the utility shall notify the applicant whether the facility meets all the applicable simplified process screens within 60 business days after the utility notifies the applicant that the application is complete.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
